docs[2]:
  - path: docs/backlog-verification.md
    scope: project
  - path: "https://nodejs.org/api/test.html#collecting-code-coverage"
    scope: project
    note: Primary Node test-runner coverage contract to verify during implementation
body: "## Scope\n\nPreserve the existing Node/V8 all-source inventory and exact three-dimensional gate while establishing a genuine, reviewable statement metric. Prefer primary runtime/tooling contracts and measured counter data over naming assumptions.\n\n## Boundary\n\nThis item does not authorize lowering thresholds, excluding executable source, or treating the line percentage as a fourth result without a testable proof."
